		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Hunched indigo spider-thing, 10 feet tall, back covered with glossy red nodules filled with harvested brains. Lamprey- like mouth extracts humanoid brains for storage.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 39, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +7 (1d8) or extract brain, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +3, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +4, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Extract Brain</strong>. Extract brain from helpless or recently dead humanoid, which gets stored in a brain nodule.</p><p></p><p><strong>Strange Knowledge</strong>. Can access memories and skills of stored brains. Store up to seven brains total.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
